# A plain DirectInput joystick: its buttons by number, its first hat, its first two axes.
control button0 jbutton 0
control button1 jbutton 1
control button2 jbutton 2
control button3 jbutton 3
control button4 jbutton 4
control button5 jbutton 5
control button6 jbutton 6
control button7 jbutton 7
control button8 jbutton 8
control button9 jbutton 9
control hat-up jhat 0 up
control hat-right jhat 0 right
control hat-down jhat 0 down
control hat-left jhat 0 left
control axis1- jaxis 1 -32767 0
control axis0+ jaxis 0 32767 0
control axis1+ jaxis 1 32767 0
control axis0- jaxis 0 -32767 0
